<pre class="src src-emacs-lisp"><code>(<span class="org-keyword">defun</span> <span class="org-function-name">my-subed-record-make-groups</span> (subtitles)
  <span class="org-doc">"Come up with a good ID for attempts, grouping by cue text."</span>
